      "writtenOn": "2020-07-17T21:40:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t add TBT_ENTER_SOP_PRIME in tbt_setup_next_vdm( ), the reasoning is:\nWhen entering tbt_setup_next_vdm( ), for active cable, the tbt state should be TBT_START for both 1st time Enter Mode and retry Enter Mode; TBT_ENTER_SOP_PRIME only for ack/nak functions.\n\nTBT_ENTER_SOP is here because active cable will go to this state after Enter Mode SOP\u0027\u0026SOP\u0027\u0027ACK.",
      "parentUuid": "8dbe59f6_b6c52780",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 339,
        "startChar": 21,
